WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.434
Swift AI: Thanks for calling Sample Local Plumbing. I’m the AI receptionist. How can I help today?

2
00:00:07.734 --> 00:00:12.593
Sample caller: Hi, our kitchen mixer tap keeps dripping. Could a plumber repair it this week?

3
00:00:12.933 --> 00:00:20.687
Swift AI: I can take the details. Is the water dripping into the sink or leaking underneath? Is there any flooding?

4
00:00:20.987 --> 00:00:26.969
Sample caller: It’s just dripping into the sink. There’s no flooding or leak underneath, and the other taps are fine.

5
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:32.473
Swift AI: Understood. May I have your name and the full address where the work is needed?

6
00:00:32.773 --> 00:00:38.162
Sample caller: I’m Sam Taylor. It’s unit two, twenty-five Example Avenue, Footscray.

7
00:00:38.502 --> 00:00:43.206
Swift AI: Thank you. What’s the best phone number for the plumber to call you on?

8
00:00:43.506 --> 00:00:47.771
Sample caller: It’s zero four nine one, five seven zero, one five six.

9
00:00:48.111 --> 00:00:57.984
Swift AI: That’s unit two, twenty-five Example Avenue, Footscray, and the number ending one five six. Are you the owner, or is it a rental?

10
00:00:58.284 --> 00:01:04.462
Sample caller: I’m the owner. I can approve the repair. I’d prefer Thursday afternoon if someone is available.

11
00:01:04.802 --> 00:01:11.343
Swift AI: I’ll note Thursday afternoon. Are there any access restrictions, and is parking available?

12
00:01:11.643 --> 00:01:19.507
Sample caller: Any time after two is good. The gate will be unlocked, and there’s space in the driveway. Could they explain the call-out fee first?

13
00:01:19.847 --> 00:01:33.912
Swift AI: Certainly. I’ll pass on the tap repair and access details. The plumber will call to discuss availability, the call-out fee and any parts before confirming a visit. Thanks, Sam.
